// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2648286209" "That's right! Katie! Everyone called me Katie! It's been so long since someone said my name I forgot what it was... That's weird, huh?<br><br>So, you said you found out where my dad is?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Seer1381DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1856949735" "I've been recalling a lot of the training they uploaded into me, and I'm pretty sure I can teleport you. I know, crazy, huh?<br><br>All I need is to know where I'm sending you and I <i>should</i> be able to just, I dunno, put you there in a blink of an eye.<br><br>Alright, trust me {HeroName}, ok? If you don't trust me I'm gonna know and then I'll get nervous and I might screw this up.<br><br>Alright, now, picture the BAF clearly in your mind and I'll teleport you there.<br><br>Do you have it? ...is that it? Are you ready?"
// Answer Text :
"P3062092588" "Yes, I can see it clearly in my mind. (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P3462356413" "Are you sure about this? You've NEVER done this before."
// Answer Text :
"P1452903092" "Wait. I'm not ready yet. (Leave)"
// Page UnsurePage1 Text :
"P3638013176" "You {Hero.gender=male wuss|scardey cat}! Come on.<br><br>Don't be afraid, you'll be perfectly safe, I promise!"
// Answer Text :
"P3924807857" "Alright, fine, let's do this. (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P3254755776" "No, I'm pretty sure this can only end in more tears. (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P614881476" "My father is in jail? Why? What did he do? What did I do!?<br><br>This is not FAIR! I didn't do anything wrong!<br><br>Why is this happening to me?<color orange>I just want to see my dad.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2002467011" "Rescue Katie's dad"
// SendOffString :
"P281951689" "What? You can't do that... Can you?<br><br>You're gonna bust my dad out of jail?<br><br><color orange>For the first time you see Katie Douglas smile. She starts to cry and hides her face in embarrassment.</color><br><br>Thank you, {HeroName}. I bet I look pathetic... a thirty year old woman crying about her dad..."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3155027385" "Rescue Henry Douglas from the BAF"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P294490083" "I'll teleport us there, seriously, I can totally do it."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2692487294" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Throw Away The Key</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3303737268" "She did it! Katie teleported you directly into the BAF... Maybe she does know what she's doing."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P899374626" "The PPD were closing in on you and Henry Douglas from all directions. You were starting to wonder if Katie really could teleport you back and then, you were standing in front of her.<br><br>Henry immediately realized that the Seer standing before him was his daughter, Catherine, and the two had a tear filled reunion. They have a lot of catching up to do."

