// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1370753605" "You rescued Katie Douglas' father from the BAF."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1054903107" "<color orange>Katie smiles at you and then grimaces, squeezing her eyes shut tight. She pushes her fingertips against the bridge of her nose and exhales sharply.</color><br><br>Ow! Ow ow ow! Massive headache...<br><br>Ok... I'm ok, it's over. Whew. That - was - intense.<br><br>I think the teleporting did it, man, I need to be really careful with my powers, that hurt <i>bad</i>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Seer1381DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3838536944" "Ready to get teleported again?"
// Answer Text :
"P3629401367" "Are you sure you're okay?"
// Answer Text :
"P2104409035" "Let's go! (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P3176410289" "Where are we even going?"
// Answer Text :
"P1008158208" "Wait, wait, wait. I forgot something. (Leave)"
// Page OKPage1 Text :
"P2807258728" "I'm fine now, I'm okay."
// Answer Text :
"P1583592676" "Alright, Let's go! (Enter Mission)"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3409649113" "I don't know what it's called, I just know where it is. Hang on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P961225482" "Dad's ok, {HeroName}, but he said they took mom and me fifteen years ago and this is the first he's seen or heard from either of us since.<br><br>{HeroName}... I... I know where my mom is. At least, I think I do. <color orange>I need you to help me find her.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P92558338" "Help Katie find her mom"
// SendOffString :
"P58992933" "While you were in the B.A.F. I was thinking, a lot. Remember that lady in my dream, {HeroName}? The one who opened the door for me to leave? And I was talking about her after you freed me?<br><br>That was her. That was my mom. I couldn't see her, but now I know for sure that it was her. And I think I know where she is.<br><br>Don't you see, {HeroName}? If I'm psychic, and my dad isn't, then that means my mom <i>must</i> be psychic. She's a Seer, like I am. Now I just need to find her.<br><br>Let's see, she was contacting me in my dream. She woke me up. She showed me the door out...<br><br>That's the key, {HeroName}, the door! When the door in my dream closed, she was on the other side! She wasn't showing me just the way out, she was showing me where she was!<br><br>I know where to find her!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2387656002" "Come on, {HeroName}. My mom needs your help!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"

